sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Human
    participant B as beacon CLI
    participant W as Capacity Watcher
    participant C as Claude
    participant X as Codex

    U->>B: beacon (work in progress)
    B->>W: monitor usage
    W->>C: check capacity
    C-->>W: 12% remaining (warning threshold crossed)
    W->>B: generate fresh ContinuationPackage now
    Note over W,B: Predictive — before the cap, not after
    C-->>W: hard cap reached
    W->>X: switch, load ContinuationPackage
    X-->>U: resuming from last WorkUnit step, no action needed
    Note over C,X: Loop repeats bidirectionally until...
    X-->>W: Codex also capped
    W->>U: Beacon: both providers unavailable, paused, state saved
